L1.G4_III_2 → I L1.G5         # న na: symbol 3/3, complete → L1.G5
L1.G5 → I L1.G5_IIU_1         # స sa: symbol 1/3 read, 2 to go
L1.G5_IIU_1 → I L1.G5_IIU_2   # స sa: symbol 2/3 read, 1 to go
L1.G5_IIU_2 → U L1.G6         # స sa: symbol 3/3, complete → L1.G6
L1.G6 → U L1.G6_UIU_1         # ర ra: symbol 1/3 read, 2 to go
